    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A servant of Summoner Sejarr, dispatched from the Ivory Tower to block the Devil Beleth. Sejarr used dark magic to imprison Beleth, but was killed by the devil's reflexive powers. Phantom alone survived of Sejarr's servitors, but was corrupted by the dark magic of Beleth and the Ivory Tower and reconciled with the Wasteland. Although he thinks his owner's death was unjust, he distrust other mystics. Animals Lv. 4 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Animals. P. Crit. Rate +25 Speed +5 P. Def. -5% Resistance to Bleed -15% Resistance to Speed Down +20% Resistance to Bow -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
